        "code": "<style>\n  html {\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  }\n\n.shieldeck-section {\n    padding: 0px 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 1050px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n  .shieldeck-title {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto 30px;\n  }\n\n.shieldeck-title span:first-child {\n    color: #191919;\n    display: block;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 0px;\n}\n\n.shieldeck-title span:last-child {\n    color: #191919 !important;\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 35px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-family: 'Instrument Serif';\n}\n\n  .shieldeck-benefits {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 20px;\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .shieldeck-benefit {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .shieldeck-benefit img {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-radius: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .shieldeck-benefit h3 {\n    font-size: 25px;\n    margin-top: 9px;\n    margin-bottom: 0px;\n    color: #191919!important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    line-height: 130%;\n  }\n\n.shieldeck-benefit p {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    color: #191919!important;\n}\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .shieldeck-title {\n      font-size: 24px;\n    }\n\n    .shieldeck-benefits {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .shieldeck-benefit h3 {\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .shieldeck-benefit p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      margin-top: -3px;\n      line-height: 150%;\n    }\n  }\n\n  .shop-btn {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    background: #E1588E!important;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 8px 50px;\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: 0.2s ease-in-out;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    display: inline-block;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  .shop-btn:hover {\n    opacity: 0.9;\n  }\n.shieldeck-title h2 {\n    font-size: 35px;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"shieldeck-section\">\n  <div class=\"shieldeck-title\">\n    <span>Science-Backed Relief.</span>\n    <h2>No Pills. No Cords. <i class=\"custom-heading-underline\">No Compromise</i></h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"shieldeck-benefits\">\n    <div class=\"shieldeck-benefit\">\n      <img class=\"review-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0721/1758/3906/files/Science_Backed_Relief_2.png?v=1780399909&width=500\" alt=\"Non‑Toxic & Chemical‑Free\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <h3>Heat Theraphy</h3>\n      <p>Eliminate flying pests with eco‑friendly UV tech, safe for your family & pets.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shieldeck-benefit\">\n      <img class=\"review-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0721/1758/3906/files/Science_Backed_Relief_4.png?v=1780399954&width=500\" alt=\"Easy Setup\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <h3>Low-Frequency Vibration</h3>\n      <p>Just insert the filter pad, plug it in, and\nstart trapping within 24 hours.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shieldeck-benefit\">\n      <img class=\"review-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0721/1758/3906/files/Science_Backed_Relief_3.png?v=1780399933&width=500\" alt=\"Fast Results\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <h3>Heat + Pressure Combo</h3>\n      <p>Our UV lure shrinks pest populations fast, expect visible results in under a week.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shieldeck-benefit\">\n      <img class=\"review-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0721/1758/3906/files/Science_Backed_Relief_1.png?v=1780399983&width=500\" alt=\"Quiet & Clean\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <h3>4,000 mAh Battery</h3>\n      <p>No zapping noise, no chemical fumes, \njust peaceful, effective bug control.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Scroll-to-top CTA Button -->\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"shop-btn\">TRY ZOLLY TODAY</a>\n</div>"
      }
    },
